                "text": "On average, the cost of a premature baby staying in the NICU is $70,000 a day. Imagine wondering how you\u2019re going to pay for that because you couldn\u2019t afford your health insurance premiums.  \n\nI led my @TheBlackCaucus colleagues to sound the alarm for millions of Americans covered by the ACA marketplace who stand to lose their health insurance because Republicans refuse to extend enhanced premium tax credits.",
