                "text": "This morning, I joined @MarchofDimes for a Congressional briefing on their 2025 Report Card on the state of infant and maternal health. For the fourth year in a row, the U.S. received a D+ with a preterm birth rate of 10.4% that heightens mortality risk for moms and babies.\n\nAs a preemie mom, I\u2019m fighting in Congress to reduce preterm births.",
