                "text": "Congressional Republicans prioritized permanent tax credits for the wealthiest few above the needs of the American people. Now, millions of Americans stand to lose access to their health insurance because of it.\n\nI anchored @TheBlackCaucus Special Order Hour on the consequences our looming health care crisis will have for families in Virginia\u2019s Fourth and beyond.\ufffc",
