                "text": "Reproductive freedom remains a public health, social justice, economic, civil rights and human rights issue \u2014 but reproductive health care has fallen further and further out of reach for millions.\n\nThis #HumanRightsDay, I joined @RepNikema and our Democratic colleagues at the federal, state and local levels to announce our resolution affirming reproductive freedom as a human right.",
