                "text": "After months of inaction, Republicans introduced a last-minute health care package that fails to actually address the health care crisis they created.\n\nI anchored a Special Order Hour from @TheBlackCaucus demanding the permanent extension of the ACA enhanced premium tax credits before they expire at the end of the year.",
